    "body": "I'm generally a fan.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds some previously-unseen complexity to our codebase, but it was sort of inevitable if we were ever going to go into nested tables or arrays in the toml file. This should serve as a nice base for us to work off of in the future.\r\n\r\nI do have a few questions about some code constructs, and I think the default style can be rewritten to be a lot shorter, but no major problems stand out.",
